---
source: tests/snapshots.rs
expression: render_rule_list(&all_rules())
---
ID                SEVERITY  DESCRIPTION
blast-radius      medium    Many resources change or are destroyed in one plan
delete            medium    A resource will be destroyed
replace           medium    A resource must be replaced (destroyed and re-created)
stateful-delete   critical  A resource that holds data (database, bucket, disk, ...) will be destroyed
stateful-replace  critical  A resource that holds data (database, bucket, disk, ...) must be replaced
